<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfólio | Cristhyan Daniel</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Crimson+Text:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --cobre: #b87333;
            --dourado: #d4af37;
            --fundo-escuro: #1a140e;
            --fundo-card: #2c1f10;
            --texto-claro: #e8d5b7;
            --texto-dourado: #f0d060;
            --fonte-titulo: 'Cinzel', serif;
            --fonte-corpo: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--fonte-corpo);
            background-color: var(--fundo-escuro);
            color: var(--texto-claro);
            line-height: 1.7;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        .navbar {
            background-color: #1f180e;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--dourado);
            padding: 8px 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .navbar.scrolled {
            background-color: #150f08;
        }

        .navbar-brand {
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--dourado) !important;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .navbar-brand:hover {
            color: #f5e56c !important;
        }

        .navbar-brand i {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--cobre);
        }

        .nav-link {
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            color: #c0a878 !important;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin: 0 3px;
            padding: 8px 16px !important;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .nav-link:hover,
        .nav-link.active {
            color: var(--dourado) !important;
            background-color: rgba(184,115,51,0.2);
            border-color: var(--cobre);
        }

        .navbar-toggler {
            border: 2px solid var(--cobre);
            padding: 6px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background-color: rgba(184,115,51,0.1);
        }

        .navbar-toggler-icon {
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 30 30'%3e%3cpath stroke='rgba(212,175,55,0.9)' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-miterlimit='10' stroke-width='2' d='M4 7h22M4 15h22M4 23h22'/%3e%3c/svg%3e");
        }

        #hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: #2a1f14;
            padding-top: 80px;
        }

        #hero h1 {
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            line-height: 1.3;
            color: var(--texto-dourado);
        }

        .typing-text {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f0d060, #d4af37, #b8960f);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            border-right: 3px solid var(--dourado);
            white-space: nowrap;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: inline-block;
            animation: blinkCursor 0.8s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes blinkCursor {
            0%,100% { border-color: transparent; }
            50% { border-color: var(--dourado); }
        }

        #hero .lead {
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 1.3rem);
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #d5c0a0;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .btn-steampunk {
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            background-color: #b07a30;
            border: 2px solid var(--dourado);
            color: #1a1008;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .btn-steampunk:hover {
            background-color: #c08a40;
            color: #0d0804;
        }

        .btn-outline-steampunk {
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid var(--dourado);
            color: var(--dourado);
            padding: 14px 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .btn-outline-steampunk:hover {
            background-color: rgba(184,115,51,0.15);
            border-color: #f0d060;
            color: #f0d060;
        }

        .hero-img-wrapper {
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .hero-img-wrapper img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 300px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 3px solid var(--cobre);
            transition: border-color 0.4s ease;
            filter: sepia(0.3) contrast(1.1);
        }

        .hero-img-wrapper img:hover {
            border-color: var(--dourado);
        }

        section {
            padding: 90px 0;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--dourado);
            text-align: center;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            margin: 8px auto 0;
            width: 80px;
            height: 3px;
            background-color: var(--dourado);
        }

        .section-subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            color: #b8a080;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .divider {
            width: 100px;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: var(--cobre);
            margin: 0 auto 50px;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        .custom-card {
            background-color: var(--fundo-card);
            border: 2px solid var(--cobre);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 35px 25px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            height: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .custom-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--dourado);
        }

        .custom-card i {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--dourado);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .custom-card h3 {
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: var(--texto-dourado);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .custom-card p {
            color: #c0a878;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .projeto-card {
            background-color: var(--fundo-card);
            border: 2px solid var(--cobre);
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .projeto-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--dourado);
        }

        .projeto-card .card-img-top {
            height: 200px;
            background-color: #3a2a1a;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: var(--dourado);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--cobre);
        }

        .projeto-card .card-body {
            padding: 25px 22px;
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .projeto-card .card-title {
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--texto-dourado);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }

        .projeto-card .card-text {
            color: #c0a878;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .badge-tech {
            background-color: rgba(184,115,51,0.25);
            color: var(--dourado);
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            margin-right: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            border: 1px solid var(--cobre);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .btn-sm {
            border-radius: 2px;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            background-color: #b07a30;
            border: 1px solid var(--dourado);
            color: #1a1008;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .btn-sm:hover {
            background-color: #c08a40;
            color: #0d0804;
        }

        .skill-bar-wrapper {
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .skill-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #d5c0a0;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .progress {
            height: 14px;
            background-color: #1f150a;
            border-radius: 2px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--cobre);
        }
        .progress-bar {
            background-color: var(--dourado);
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: width 1.5s ease;
            width: 0%;
        }

        #contato .form-control {
            background-color: #2c1f10;
            border: 2px solid var(--cobre);
            border-radius: 2px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            color: #e8d5b7;
            font-family: var(--fonte-corpo);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        #contato .form-control:focus {
            border-color: var(--dourado);
            background-color: #3a2a1a;
        }
        #contato .form-control::placeholder {
            color: #8a7a60;
        }

        .btn-submit {
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            background-color: #b07a30;
            border: 2px solid var(--dourado);
            padding: 14px 40px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #1a1008;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .btn-submit:hover {
            background-color: #c08a40;
        }

        .contato-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            padding: 18px 22px;
            background-color: var(--fundo-card);
            border: 2px solid var(--cobre);
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #c0a878;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .contato-item:hover {
            border-color: var(--dourado);
            color: var(--texto-dourado);
        }
        .contato-item i {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--dourado);
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #1a1008;
            border-top: 3px double var(--dourado);
            padding: 40px 0 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        footer .social-icons a {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: rgba(184,115,51,0.2);
            color: var(--dourado);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin: 0 10px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 2px solid var(--cobre);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        footer .social-icons a:hover {
            background-color: #b07a30;
            color: #1a1008;
            border-color: var(--dourado);
        }
        .footer-text span {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f0d060, #d4af37);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: var(--fonte-titulo);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .scroll-top-btn {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: #b07a30;
            border: 2px solid var(--dourado);
            color: #1a1008;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 999;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .scroll-top-btn.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            visibility: visible;
        }
        .scroll-top-btn:hover {
            background-color: #c08a40;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-img-wrapper img {
                max-width: 200px;
            }
            section {
                padding: 60px 0;
            }
        }
       /* Animações de entrada */
.reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
}
.reveal.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
}

/* Efeito hover de levantamento nos cards */
.custom-card, .projeto-card {
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}
.custom-card:hover, .projeto-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg fixed-top" id="navbar">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="#hero">
                <i class="bi bi-gear-fill"></i> Cristhyan Daniel
            </a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="#hero">Início</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#sobre">Sobre</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#formacao">Formação</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#habilidades">Habilidades</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#projetos">Projetos</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#contato">Contato</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section id="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row align-items-center">
                <div class="col-lg-7">
                    <h1 class="text-white mb-2">
                        Olá, eu sou<br>
                        <span class="typing-text" id="typingName"></span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="lead">
                        Sou Cristhyan Daniel, estudante do Colégio Estadual Presidente Kennedy, tenho 16 anos e curso DS (desenvolvimento de sistemas).
                    </p>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3 flex-wrap mt-4">
                        <a href="#projetos" class="btn-steampunk"><i class="bi bi-gear-fill"></i> Projetos</a>
                        <a href="#contato" class="btn-outline-steampunk"><i class="bi bi-chat-dots-fill"></i> Contato</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-5 text-center">
                    <div class="hero-img-wrapper">
                        <img src="https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Cristhyan+Daniel&background=b87333&color=fff&size=400" alt="Avatar de Cristhyan Daniel" class="img-fluid">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="sobre">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Sobre Mim</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Um pouco da minha jornada</p>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="custom-card">
                        <i class="bi bi-lightbulb-fill"></i>
                        <h3>Criatividade</h3>
                        <p>Gosto de criar soluções criativas e funcionais para cada desafio que encontro.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="custom-card">
                        <i class="bi bi-tools"></i>
                        <h3>Conhecimento Técnico</h3>
                        <p>Trabalho com HTML, CSS, JavaScript e Python, construindo projetos com dedicação.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="custom-card">
                        <i class="bi bi-compass"></i>
                        <h3>Determinação</h3>
                        <p>Meu objetivo é crescer na área de desenvolvimento de software e fazer a diferença.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="formacao" style="background-color: #1a140e;">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Formação</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Minha trajetória acadêmica</p>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-md-8">
                    <div class="custom-card text-start">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                            <i class="bi bi-building-fill" style="font-size: 2.5rem;"></i>
                            <h3 class="mb-0" style="color:#f0d060; font-family:var(--fonte-titulo);">Colégio Estadual Presidente Kennedy</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p style="color:#c0a878;">Curso Técnico em Desenvolvimento de Sistemas (DS) — Integrado ao Ensino Médio.</p>
                        <p style="color:#c0a878;"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check me-2"></i>Início: 2025 • Previsão de conclusão: 2027</p>
                        <p style="color:#c0a878;">Disciplinas: Lógica de Programação, Banco de Dados, Desenvolvimento Web, Algoritmos.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="habilidades">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Habilidades Técnicas</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Minhas competências</p>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-lg-8">
                    <div class="skill-bar-wrapper">
                        <div class="skill-info"><span><i class="bi bi-filetype-html me-2" style="color:#e34c26;"></i>HTML5</span><span>90%</span></div>
                        <div class="progress"><div class="progress-bar" data-width="90%"></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="skill-bar-wrapper">
                        <div class="skill-info"><span><i class="bi bi-filetype-css me-2" style="color:#264de4;"></i>CSS3</span><span>85%</span></div>
                        <div class="progress"><div class="progress-bar" data-width="85%"></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="skill-bar-wrapper">
                        <div class="skill-info"><span><i class="bi bi-filetype-js me-2" style="color:#f0db4f;"></i>JavaScript</span><span>70%</span></div>
                        <div class="progress"><div class="progress-bar" data-width="70%"></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="skill-bar-wrapper">
                        <div class="skill-info"><span><i class="bi bi-filetype-py me-2" style="color:#306998;"></i>Python</span><span>65%</span></div>
                        <div class="progress"><div class="progress-bar" data-width="65%"></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="projetos" style="background-color: #1a140e;">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Projetos Recentes</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Trabalhos desenvolvidos</p>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-5">
                    <div class="projeto-card">
                        <div class="card-img-top">
                            <i class="bi bi-calculator-fill"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">Calculadora Python</h5>
                            <p class="card-text">Calculadora de terminal desenvolvida em Python com operações aritméticas completas, tratamento de erros e interface amigável.</p>
                            <div>
                                <span class="badge-tech">Python</span>
                                <span class="badge-tech">CLI</span>
                                <span class="badge-tech">Lógica</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-5">
                    <div class="projeto-card">
                        <div class="card-img-top">
                            <i class="bi bi-dice-6-fill"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">Jogo da Cobrinha</h5>
                            <p class="card-text">Clássico Snake Game recriado com Python e Pygame, com sistema de pontuação, níveis de dificuldade e design retrô.</p>
                            <div>
                                <span class="badge-tech">Python</span>
                                <span class="badge-tech">Pygame</span>
                                <span class="badge-tech">Game</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contato">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Entre em Contato</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Fale comigo</p>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="row g-5">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <form id="contactForm">
                        <input type="text" class="form-control mb-3" placeholder="Seu nome" id="nome" required>
                        <input type="email" class="form-control mb-3" placeholder="seu@email.com" id="email" required>
                        <textarea class="form-control mb-3" rows="5" placeholder="Sua mensagem..." id="mensagem" required></textarea>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn-submit"><i class="bi bi-send-fill"></i> Enviar</button>
